{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_ifrit_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_ifrit_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"小隊長","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ifrit_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"21237fa00f795d9baf87e8c40c4e4f5bf4348bc319ab4c917ad8da2a4334ac19","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"赫默暫時離開羅德島，伊芙利特與艾雅法拉等幹員一同外出執行任務，作為隊長，她需要負起責任，帶領小隊。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，你回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天怎麼這麼早，博士沒給你新的任務？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療部說這兩天要複查，不准我往外跑，博士也讓我休息兩天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，你收拾這些行李幹嘛......你要出遠門嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。有事要出門一趟，可能會耗些時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪？就你一個人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也帶上我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一個人去，不過別擔心，會有人幫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次不能帶你一起，伊芙利特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，你是不是......是不是要回那裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道塞雷婭一直在查和那些白大褂有關的事！我知道赫默你也是，還有繆繆，她來找塞雷婭，也和那些討厭的傢伙有關......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你們什麼都不說，但我能猜得到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我吧！赫默，我不是小孩子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你已經不是孩子了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你變瘦了，赫默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你長高，長大了，伊芙利特。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"黎博利那雙常年與實驗材料為伴，靈活柔韌卻又覆著一層薄薄繭皮的手，從細碎的鬢髮一路下滑，撫過伊芙利特已顯出棱角的下頜。\n在伊芙利特記憶中，赫默很少真正與她十分親暱。\n多數時候，只有微涼的指尖輕輕碰觸，好像她是什麼惹人心驚的易碎品。\n只有從前偶爾一兩回，她病得都要瞧不清人了，卻能清晰感到有一雙這樣的手，落在她身上。\n那手好像有些顫抖，但卻令伊芙利特瞬間感到安定，彷彿有了依靠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"現在，這雙手先是虛落在她臉上，隨後便穩穩地扶住她的肩，她努力將腰板又挺直了些，希望自己能夠看上去更加成熟可靠。\n她聽黎博利歎了一口氣，開口說："},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你長大了。”\n“很多事情，確實不該再瞞著你。”\n“我和塞雷婭，接下來要回哥倫比亞一趟。”\n“我們要做的事不僅與你當年的遭遇有關，還牽扯到更多事。”\n“伊芙利特，我希望你......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......芙利特，伊芙利特？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你睡著了？可以起來了，檢查已經完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，是有哪裡不舒服嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生不在，我們也只是幫你做些基礎檢查，目前看來是沒什麼明顯的問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"要是不舒服，就一定要說出來！"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊芙利特並不打算同醫療幹員多說，自她躺上手術台的那一天以來，肢體的疼痛如影隨形，從未有所消解。\n從前她覺得痛了，就會哭，會鬧，會徹夜難眠。\n而時至今日，伊芙利特早已習慣這種註定會永久伴隨她的疼痛。\n這沒什麼大不了的，她扛得住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"緊張什麼！別大驚小怪的，我就是躺得太久頭暈，沒什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，現在檢查也做完了，我能走了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你等一下，我把這次的體檢報告裝好給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了，報告呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎等下，你這是什麼表情，你、你別哭啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我才沒有哭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，愛哭包！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然、雖然你的詳細資料只有赫默醫生有權限調取，一直以來我只是輔助赫默醫生，但我心裡也清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾年來，就連體表能看得見的源石結晶都更多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"再這麼下去你的病情會惡化得更快！你總說沒事，但是怎麼可能沒事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，我建議你安心休養——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，別說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不會按照你們的意思乖乖待在房間裡不出去的，整天不是抽血就是吃藥，什麼都做不了，這不可能！這樣又有什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"可是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有可是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有可是。雖然赫默很多事都沒和我說太多，但我又不傻，自己的身體怎麼樣，我自己最清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就因為我清楚得很，所以才更不能什麼都不做就這麼乾等著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是要變得比塞雷婭還厲害才行！要是能那樣，不管發生什麼事，我都能幫得上忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒太多時間可以浪費了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會再勸你，相信你自己已經能做決定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？！又怎麼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"該注意的地方我是不會鬆口的！你不能再像上次一樣亂來了，一個人燒掉一整座賞金獵人營地，都傷成那樣了還滿腦子想著任務......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"要是這次你再滿身是血被抬回來......哼哼！下個月你也別想出病房！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是沒辦法嘛......！我又不想的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這次我可是隊長欸！這還是我頭一次當隊長呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長怎麼了？隊長更要注意自己的身體了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這是止痛的藥劑，你要出外勤，就多帶上兩瓶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，你回來一定要第一時間過來檢查！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，知道了，真囉嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳咳，不管怎麼說，總而言之，謝了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，我肯定沒事的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“伊芙利特，我希望你......”\n一直到離開，赫默也沒把這句話說完。\n伊芙利特只能猜測她的意思，赫默她想說的是什麼？她希望她怎麼樣？\n她是希望自己能幫她做些什麼嗎？是有什麼任務要交代給自己嗎？還是說，希望自己能再懂事一點，別讓她離開之後還要替自己擔心？\n伊芙利特想了又想，心底隱隱地覺得，或許赫默只是想說，希望她能平安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赫默與塞雷婭對待她的態度是不同的。\n塞雷婭或許一直都期待她成長，能夠獨當一面。而赫默，其實從來只是想要她能平安地生活罷了。\n赫默說她長高了，長大了。\n伊芙利特清楚，她最初還覺得自己充滿力量、強悍無匹，但實際上，她還沒能長大到令赫默刮目相看，令她覺得自己可以依靠的地步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"還不夠。\n還遠著呢。\n她還有好長的路要走，但時間已經不算多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......沒想到這裡真的有這麼大的山洞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"艾雅法拉前輩好厲害！和前輩推測的位置幾乎完全一致耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那邊有一塊好漂亮的石頭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡好涼爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺會很適合午睡，這裡靠上去冰冰的、涼涼的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......奇怪，這個山洞的位置和規模，都和測算出的結果有一些偏差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然偏差值還在正常範圍內，不過，稍微有點令人在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的濕度有點偏高，還有泥土......總感覺並不緊實......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"內部的土壤也要測一下......哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"謝、謝謝你，伊芙利特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先站穩再說話......你剛剛是不是擦到了？手劃破沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"你別緊張，我沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有沒有事是我來判斷，我是隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手，讓我看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，還好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，玩沙子的！你也是來護衛的，別偷懶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？啊，沒關係的，就算摔倒也不會疼的，我有在注意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"就像這樣......我會接住艾雅法拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特要一起來嗎，這裡涼涼的，很舒服哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我就算了，你自己靠著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次任務就是探查這片洞窟及附近的地質是吧？那就抓緊時間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇！大家快過來這邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有好多漂亮的礦石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特！這裡有一塊特別適合你的，快來啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也別玩了！快點幹活！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地質怎樣我不懂，但這次隊長是我，你們得聽我指揮！你們的安全也由我負責......算我拜託你們，趕緊把工作做完吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是你黑耳朵！沒有本隊長的允許不許再亂跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"是！保證聽從隊長命令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，伊芙利特，這個給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這什麼東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這邊撿到的礦石，你看這個紅色，是不是很適合你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，送給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......哼！不就是塊石頭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"你不喜歡嗎？真的很襯你呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行、行了，我又沒說不要！幹嘛那副表情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不快拿來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特又害羞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，懶得和你說。艾雅法拉，你那邊怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"我們進來的一路上，我都做了採集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"目前還沒有發現什麼，只是，這裡果然和我之前的測算有些出入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我們需要再深入一些，看一看內部的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還等什麼？我們走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼感覺，有點冷起來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還要再往裡走嗎？這洞穴到底有多深啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，按照測算，我們現在大約才走了一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"深處的土壤，採集好了。給，這樣就可以了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這樣就可以了，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"有了這些樣本，就可以做詳細的分析了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能分析出啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"很多，我們這次主要是觀察這裡的地層是否穩定，還有要做和天災相關的評估......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"說到這個，我也有一個在意的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"這一路上，地面上能看到不少碎裂的礦石，應該是從這邊山體的裂隙掉落的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"好奇怪，正常情況下，應該不會產生這麼多裂縫才對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，不應該是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的裂縫，我想去看一看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，你剛剛打了第十一個哈欠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"艾雅法拉和薄綠應該還要一段時間，如果你很睏的話，可以來和我靠在一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煩，都說了不要了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這趟博士特地叮囑我要照顧好你們幾個，哼，小菜一碟，博士太小瞧我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，既然這樣，那你為什麼還這麼緊張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你少瞎說，誰緊張了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這叫負責！負責懂嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們倆都是護衛，你也給我精神點，到時候別拖後腿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有聽到什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......從剛剛起，就不是很安穩的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"越來越接近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——出來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的幾個裂口太大了！這根本不可能是自然形成的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這個資料結果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了！是源石蟲群！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的礦石層比其他地方更疏鬆，是因為有數量可觀的源石蟲群在這裡繁衍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"還有偏低的溫度和較高的濕度都可以從這個方向找到解釋，從這個結果來看，這裡、這裡的岩層很可能已經變得非常不穩定了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"前輩哇啊啊你說的對但是源石蟲已經湧出來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，確實是一大群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"艾雅法拉，好厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是說這些的時候嗎？！分析得是沒錯但先別分析了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數量太多了，我們快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的，這群蟲子怎麼還在追！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看我把你們都燒了——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，怎麼樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是些蟲子，就成為本伊芙利特大人久違的燒烤吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，沒完沒了......煩死人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是你們自找的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不許擋我的路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特燒焦了一大群！但是數量還是很多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！它們又追上來了！這種源石蟲的習性就是這樣......會一直追擊入侵者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，慢吞吞的小羊！你還撐得住嗎？不行就說，我扛著你走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"慢吞吞......小、小羊？！是說我嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你還有誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"我......咳咳，還好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"我的沙土也沒有辦法阻攔太久......嗯，傷腦筋了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，我受不了了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我來看看到底還能有多少蟲子，來多少我就燒多少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......等一等，伊芙利特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"別再用你的源石技藝了！這裡的岩層結構不夠穩定，而你的火焰......太強烈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不好好控制的話，很有可能......會導致坍塌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一會你們先走，我留下來對付這些源石蟲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次任務你們該聽我的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛，你們該不會以為我是要當什麼電影裡的孤膽英雄吧？哼，赫默自從看了幾部那種片子，就天天和我罵裡面的主角是傻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不當傻子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然岩層不能燒，那我就控制住不燒不就行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"有......道理？但是伊芙利特，你能控制得住嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以！我一定會做到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我。我說了，你們的安全都由我負責！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"char_344_beewax","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，好。我相信你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......都走光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，總算可以放開手腳燒個痛快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小東西，你忍不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，想看我失控？做夢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明知道我已經學會怎麼控制那些火了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的力量給我，氣球胖子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這就是你求人的態度嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少廢話，和你知會一聲，已經夠禮貌了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你除了讓我痛，還能做得到什麼？我早就不怕你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要燒什麼，要怎麼燒，都是我的自由！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"呼呼，小東西，你的口氣又變大了。\n你知道她們其實沒有走開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又怎麼樣，我能保護她們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會，再傷到我的同伴......我的、朋友......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊芙利特曾經沒法控制燃燒在自己身體中的那團火。\n伊芙利特曾經發誓，總有一天要將其控制，不讓它傷到那些她愛的人。\n塞雷婭說對不起時，她艱難地睜開了眼。\n雪亮的刀鋒近在咫尺，但比刀鋒更加刺人的，卻是塞雷婭眼中溢滿的悲傷。\n伊芙利特再也不想看到那樣的表情。她不會再讓塞雷婭，讓赫默露出那樣的表情。\n她已經不再像從前那樣無力。\n她已經可以做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我看好了！死胖子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些火不再聽你的話亂來......它們會聽我號令，它們屬於我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遲早會徹底把你幹掉！你就等著吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，檢查結束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又沒受傷，真搞不懂有什麼好檢查的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"火燒了一整個洞窟，還聯合其他幹員一起使用源石技藝，差點把洞口填平......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你們哪裡來的這麼大的膽子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，怎麼連你都知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓我知道到底是誰告的密，又沒什麼大不了的，有什麼好到處說的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說，聽起來還是挺刺激的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這事要是被赫默知道了，你猜猜你每天的作業會翻幾倍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"等赫默醫生回來，我當然會告訴她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道這有多危險嗎！萬一......萬一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是沒事嗎！你別老是念叨我，這次我特別小心了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說回來要來檢查，我也來了，還要怎樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以別告訴赫默行嗎！別告訴她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦喲，現在倒是知道怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是怕！我就是......那什麼，不想讓赫默擔心而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道赫默什麼時候能回來，要是塞雷婭也能一起回來就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......她們嘛，事情解決了自然就會回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先聲明，別問我是什麼事啊。我也不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一圈的破事我都懶得管，什麼都不問才能保清淨，我改裝我的咪波都嫌時間不夠，才不想管其他的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，這段時間你也聽話一點，博士應該和你說了，接下來不許你再出去了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"再過幾天，我們也要進入哥倫比亞了，到時候你可千萬不能再亂來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，知道啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默和我說了她要做的事......我不會給赫默還有塞雷婭她們添麻煩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"avg_242_otter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，看來你真的長大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，等著瞧吧，總有一天......我會變得很可靠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候，赫默也不會老是擔心我，再有什麼麻煩事，也會考慮讓我幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“伊芙利特，幫幫我們！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_134_ifrit_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，真想快點聽到這句話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_180_amgoat","aliases":["艾雅法拉"]},{"speakerId":"char_344_beewax","aliases":["蜜蠟"]},{"speakerId":"char_388_mint","aliases":["薄綠"]}]}
